### ============================================================
### Notifications — in-app (milik user login)
### Login sebagai peminjam setelah laboran approve request
### untuk melihat notifikasi status peminjaman.
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}
@token = {{token}}
@notificationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List notifications (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unread count (badge)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark notification as read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
